  "readme": "\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMesh:\n\nThis folder contains all necessary files related to the 3D tetrahedral meshes generated for this project.\n---\nBigMesh_60M: \n60 million(M) element mesh in the following data types\n  .ele, .elem, .mat, .node, .ply, .pts, .txt, and .vtk\n---\nScaledMesh_15M: 15M element mesh in the following data types\n  .ele, .elem, .mat, .node, .ply, .pts, .txt, .obj, and .vtk\n---\nSizing Fields: sizing fields in .nrrd format.\n  Cleaver_0.6_1.0_1.0_sizing_field.nrrd: sizing field for 60M element mesh.\n  Updated_sizing_field_27.nrrd: sizing field for 15M element mesh.\n---\nNetworks: SCIRun4 network files\n  flat_tets_test.srn: testing for flat tetrahedra in the mesh.\n  ViewBadTets.srn: viewing the flat tetrahedra in the mesh. \n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
